          "book": "HEB",
          "chapter": 13,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "Don’t forget to show hospitality to strangers, for in doing so, some have entertained angels without knowing it.",
      "ko": "손님 대접하기를 잊지 말라 이로써 부지중에 천사들을 대접한 이들이 있었느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "148466545ff93c47ba9c7e59b754270f460946b23a52ccd870fbe22d7f236013",
      "translation_text_hash": "1323caceb8d8ade6f6bd4b4b81685b39997d32cbf16d023f462d5a39005b0813",
