      "en": "Jesus Christ is the same yesterday, today, and forever.",
      "ko": "예수 그리스도는 어제나 오늘이나 영원토록 동일하시니라",
      "source_text_hash": "98f801ac44e27f20150fdf5da10d5a584c38fe8f4eb5904d91ae412130e87858",
      "translation_text_hash": "4ede469323b83c665b624f8b7a464e61ac12a8cb5bff01d9355cfc1118b17894",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "예수 그리스도는 어제나 오늘이나 영원토록 동일하시니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "4ede469323b83c665b624f8b7a464e61ac12a8cb5bff01d9355cfc1118b17894"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:HEB:13:9",
      "sequence": 30247,
      "chapter_label": "HEB 13",
      "verse_label": "9",
      "locator": {
        "book": "HEB",
