      "en": "For the bodies of those animals, whose blood is brought into the holy place by the high priest as an offering for sin, are burned outside of the camp.",
      "ko": "이는 죄를 위한 짐승의 피는 대제사장이 가지고 성소에 들어가고 그 육체는 영문 밖에서 불사름이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "d48f7206a4819aa7d4c0c91c61526957d0d12cdc5aa09b9439a20f146971c842",
      "translation_text_hash": "b95096906899ea81edafba32b981ed7be7b2fa97260db11c64d458a191671111",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
